  "details": "It would be nice to have a way in game to exchange messages with friends (not by abusing the invite feature) so that friends can text each other even if they are not in the same instance.\n\nThe reason I suggest this is because constantly sending 'invite requests' to send simple messages to a friend feels rude and intrusive, When all I might want to do is simply say Hi, or ask if they're busy without spamming them with invite requests. I just think this is an essential feature that is missing from VRChat.\n\nI also suggest friends specifically and not 'Anyone' because limiting it to friends only therefore serves as an essential form of self moderation from unwanted spam/unsolicited messages.",
